of had grown jaded

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:05.338 align:start size:97% position:3%
with the television business
and local news business

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:08.575
because there had been a lot
of corporate consolidation.

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:13.146 align:start size:97% position:3%
And there was less
autonomy at the local level

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:14.948
for reporters like myself

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:17.384 align:start size:84% position:16%
and anchors to
pursue stories that

00:00:17.384 --> 00:00:20.453 align:start size:94% position:6%
