important to our audience.

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:23.423
There were a lot of mandates
from the corporate offices

00:00:23.423 --> 00:00:25.025
and edicts from on high,

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:27.027
and we're gonna focus on this

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:31.431 align:start size:97% position:3%
and I think that's problematic
with our country right now

00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:34.334 align:start size:84% position:16%
where you have a
lot less local news,

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:37.337 align:start size:84% position:16%
a lot less investment
in local news

00:00:37.337 --> 00:00:40.340 align:start size:84% position:16%
and you have less
coverage of the places

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:44.344
