00:02:06.726 --> 00:02:10.263 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
I'm a traditional
TV news anchor type,

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:13.766
I worked for about 20
years in local news,

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:19.739
