lines of American politics

00:02:33.253 --> 00:02:34.721
and of course, West Palm beach,

00:02:34.721 --> 00:02:36.422
Palm beach County was
one of those areas

00:02:36.422 --> 00:02:40.760 align:start size:97% position:3%
where you have a pretty
diverse political population

00:02:42.095 --> 00:02:45.665 align:start position:0%
