00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:39.405 align:start size:81% position:19%
because we compete
with our ideas.

00:10:39.405 --> 00:10:42.208
And I think in the long term

00:10:42.208 --> 00:10:44.810
you ask people of a certain age,

00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:48.080
they're more conservators at
the later end of your lifespan

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:49.482
than the younger folks,

00:10:49.482 --> 00:10:51.350
it's because conservative ideas

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:54.387
