00:11:13.372 --> 00:11:17.076 align:start size:97% position:3%
and really defend those
principles throughout history.

00:11:17.076 --> 00:11:18.544
- And it's very exciting

00:11:18.544 --> 00:11:20.513 align:start size:97% position:3%
because we have those things
for another seven days.

00:11:20.513 --> 00:11:21.714
(laughing)

00:11:21.714 --> 00:11:23.416 align:start size:81% position:19%
- Well, I honestly
think, I mean,

00:11:23.416 --> 00:11:26.085
this is scary for a
lot of folks here but

00:11:26.085 --> 00:11:28.387 align:start size:84% position:16%
I'm reminded of many
times in history

00:11:28.387 --> 00:11:30.589 align:start size:88% position:13%
when we talked about
how bad things could be,

00:11:30.589 --> 00:11:32.825
I try to take stock in the fact

00:11:32.825 --> 00:11:34.527
that we do have the
most divided Congress

00:11:34.527 --> 00:11:37.296
basically we've ever
had in our history,

00:11:37.296 --> 00:11:39.331 align:start size:84% position:16%
