split as it could be

00:11:39.331 --> 00:11:40.599
in the house and the Senate.

00:11:40.599 --> 00:11:42.935
And for somebody
like Kamala Harris

00:11:42.935 --> 00:11:45.905 align:start size:97% position:3%
who was the deciding vote,
the tie breaker in the Senate,

00:11:45.905 --> 00:11:48.774 align:start size:94% position:6%
