00:12:00.086 --> 00:12:01.520 align:start size:84% position:16%
You know, eliminating
all the history

00:12:01.520 --> 00:12:04.490 align:start size:94% position:6%
and all the positive
things that that has done

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:08.360 align:start size:84% position:16%
to thwart the tyranny
of the masses,

00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:10.029
the things that could have,

00:12:10.029 --> 00:12:12.698
if it weren't for the
electoral college,

00:12:12.698 --> 00:12:14.800
slavery would have existed
probably much longer Dave.

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:16.836
So these are the things
they wanna tear down,

00:12:16.836 --> 00:12:19.805
we know it's kind of
symbolic at this point

00:12:19.805 --> 00:12:23.042
and I'm really hopeful while
