00:12:28.114 --> 00:12:29.949 align:start size:88% position:13%
that there are
unintended consequences

00:12:29.949 --> 00:12:32.952
and it usually comes back
to bite them in the ass.

00:12:32.952 --> 00:12:34.420
- Yeah.

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:37.323 align:start size:97% position:3%
Listen, I hope you're right,
I do hope you're right,

00:12:37.323 --> 00:12:39.225 align:start size:84% position:16%
but I actually
think they wanna do

00:12:39.225 --> 00:12:42.261 align:start size:94% position:6%
absolutely everything that
they say they wanna do

00:12:42.261 --> 00:12:43.996
and the electoral college stuff,

00:12:43.996 --> 00:12:45.731
the PAC and the court stuff,

00:12:45.731 --> 00:12:48.367 align:start size:84% position:16%
whether it's post
