00:12:48.367 --> 00:12:51.570
like just whatever crazy bananas

00:12:51.570 --> 00:12:52.905
thing someone puts up there,

00:12:52.905 --> 00:12:54.740
I think they wanna do all of it.

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:57.610
I just see, do you see
any reason to think,

00:12:57.610 --> 00:12:59.912
is there anything in
the movement right now

00:12:59.912 --> 00:13:03.582
