00:13:16.495 --> 00:13:19.331
but there are polls out there
that showed us the same thing

00:13:19.331 --> 00:13:20.533
as it showed us last time

00:13:20.533 --> 00:13:22.635 align:start size:84% position:16%
when they were talking
about impeachment,

00:13:22.635 --> 00:13:24.036 align:start size:84% position:16%
the country is evenly
divided on this

00:13:24.036 --> 00:13:27.206
and I still believe
in the collective

00:13:27.206 --> 00:13:29.508
kind of power of the
individual of course,

00:13:29.508 --> 00:13:30.943
but the American public too

00:13:30.943 --> 00:13:33.078 align:start size:84% position:16%
and there were a
